OL,3,GNEWSAJudge praises woman's bravery as
OL,4,Arapist jailed
OL,5,
OL,6,FA judge has praised a woman's courage
OL,7,Ffor reporting her "dangerous" rapist,
OL,8,Fwho has been jailed for more than 15
OL,9,Fyears.
OL,11,FSamual Walker, 28, tormented his victim
OL,12,Fand ignored her pleas to stop, Teesside
OL,13,FCrown Court heard.
OL,15,FWalker, from Grangetown, had denied
OL,16,Foffending but changed his pleas and
OL,17,Fadmitted offences including rape as the
OL,18,Fwoman neared the end of giving evidence
OL,19,Fat his trial.
